  "body_html": "<h1>Value Of A Zero-Sum Game</h1>\n<p>A zero-sum game has a value if its maxmin and minmax coincide.  In that case\nthe common number is denoted\n$$\n  \\operatorname{val}(G)=\\underline v=\\overline v.\n$$</p>",
